    {
      "id": "43788606",
      "title": "Adding More Components to the Demo App",
      "lectureOrder": 45,
      "videoOrder": 41,
      "sourceHash": "904fcde4597184130e03f05aa3742112d4b1de99ec1d696eecef76aa796824be",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.43,
          "en": "So slowly but steadily",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "this application is taking shape.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 6.99,
          "en": "But of course if we select a user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.99,
          "end": 9.69,
          "en": "we at the moment only see their name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.69,
          "end": 12.39,
          "en": "and that's what we'll change now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.39,
          "end": 16.92,
          "en": "For that, we can go to that tasks component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.92,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "and in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 21,
          "en": "instead of just outputting their name like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21,
          "end": 25.023,
          "en": "I now want to add a bit more markup and content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.31,
          "end": 29.19,
          "en": "For example, for styling purposes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.19,
          "end": 33.24,
          "en": "I want to add a section with an id of tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.24,
          "end": 36.69,
          "en": "And in that section I want to add a header element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.69,
          "end": 39.42,
          "en": "so the standard built in header element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.42,
          "end": 42.573,
          "en": "and move this h2 element into this header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.7,
          "end": 47.37,
          "en": "And I also don't just wanna output the name of the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.37,
          "end": 51.81,
          "en": "but instead name then single quote s Tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.95,
          "end": 56.883,
          "en": "so that this will say Emily's tasks and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.74,
          "end": 61.5,
          "en": "Now below this h2 element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.5,
          "end": 65.01,
          "en": "I'll add a menu which contains one button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.01,
          "end": 68.37,
          "en": "which will later allow us to add a new task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.37,
          "end": 71.223,
          "en": "Hence it has a caption of Add Task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.39,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "Later we'll add a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 75.9,
          "en": "and do something when it's clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.9,
          "end": 78,
          "en": "But for now we'll just leave it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.83,
          "end": 82.68,
          "en": "And then below this header, the idea is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.68,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "to output an unordered list of tasks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 90.84,
          "en": "so of the tasks that have been assigned to a user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.84,
          "end": 95.37,
          "en": "And for that we'll soon build a dedicated custom component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 99.423,
          "en": "which will be output as a list item in that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.41,
          "end": 103.17,
          "en": "That's the idea here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.17,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "Now with that change made, if we select a user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 110.88300000000001,
          "en": "this looks like this, which is not too great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 115.25999999999999,
          "en": "The reason for that is that we currently got no styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.25999999999999,
          "end": 116.75999999999999,
          "en": "for this component yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.75999999999999,
          "end": 118.8,
          "en": "and that's why attached you find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.8,
          "end": 122.79,
          "en": "a prepared tasks.component.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.79,
          "end": 125.973,
          "en": "which does include some styles for this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 130.53,
          "en": "Now we already are linking to that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.53,
          "end": 133.83,
          "en": "here in the tasks component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.83,
          "end": 137.52,
          "en": "and therefore those styles will be included.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.52,
          "end": 140.493,
          "en": "And if you reload, this now looks much better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.11,
          "end": 144.27,
          "en": "So that's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.27,
          "end": 148.14,
          "en": "The next step now is to output some tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.14,
          "end": 149.613,
          "en": "for our users here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150.54,
          "end": 153.69,
          "en": "Now in order to output multiple tasks here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 153.69,
          "end": 157.53,
          "en": "I wanna create a new reusable task component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 160.473,
          "en": "So a component that outputs an individual task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.37,
          "end": 165.48,
          "en": "And we can do this with help of the Angular CLI again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165.48,
          "end": 169.2,
          "en": "and you can of course absolutely also try this on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.2,
          "end": 171.72,
          "en": "first as a little exercise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.72,
          "end": 174.84,
          "en": "that you create a new task component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 177.93,
          "en": "and you then output a list of such tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 180.843,
          "en": "inside of this tasks component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.74,
          "end": 186.45,
          "en": "The task component, so the component for an individual task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.45,
          "end": 189.213,
          "en": "can simply output some dummy data for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.62,
          "end": 192.87,
          "en": "I'll create this new component now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.87,
          "end": 197.223,
          "en": "by again using the Angular CLI to generate a new component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 199.23,
          "en": "And I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.23,
          "end": 203.4,
          "en": "to generate this new component in the tasks folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.4,
          "end": 206.01,
          "en": "And this is how you can do this with the CLI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 206.01,
          "end": 209.86,
          "en": "You define the path to the component that should be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.72,
          "end": 214.8,
          "en": "tasks/ and then the name of the new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.8,
          "end": 216.453,
          "en": "task in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 220.2,
          "en": "Again, I need no automated tests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.2,
          "end": 224.07,
          "en": "so I'll add --skip-tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.07,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 228.78,
          "en": "this task folder here is created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.78,
          "end": 232.832,
          "en": "In there for the moment we can simply output a task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.832,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 238.02,
          "en": "And then in the tasks.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.02,
          "end": 240.6,
          "en": "we can use that here in the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.6,
          "end": 244.023,
          "en": "Use the newly added app-task component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.1,
          "end": 247.74,
          "en": "Of course, as always, in order to use it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 247.74,
          "end": 250.02,
          "en": "it must first be unlocked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.02,
          "end": 254.26,
          "en": "so we can auto import it into the tasks component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 255.24,
          "end": 257.553,
          "en": "so that it's added to imports there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 259.05,
          "end": 261.96,
          "en": "And with that done it will be output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.96,
          "end": 265.29,
          "en": "And now we could output multiple tasks here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 265.29,
          "end": 267.9,
          "en": "We can't use @for yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.9,
          "end": 271.14,
          "en": "because we don't really have any list data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 271.14,
          "end": 273.9,
          "en": "that would allow us to output multiple tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 273.9,
          "end": 274.95,
          "en": "That will change soon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 274.95,
          "end": 278.43,
          "en": "but for the moment we can simply output it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 278.43,
          "end": 281.4,
          "en": "With that, if you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 281.4,
          "end": 283.563,
          "en": "you will see some tasks here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 284.97,
          "end": 288.3,
          "en": "Now I wanna improve the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.3,
          "end": 292.65,
          "en": "and also the markup of this task component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 292.65,
          "end": 297.65,
          "en": "and therefore attached you find a task.component.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 298.5,
          "end": 301.02,
          "en": "which contains some styles you should place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 301.02,
          "end": 304.023,
          "en": "in your task.component.css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 305.19,
          "end": 308.91,
          "en": "And back in the task component template file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.91,
          "end": 312.03,
          "en": "so in this task.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 312.03,
          "end": 313.84,
          "en": "I will now add an article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 314.85,
          "end": 317.88,
          "en": "and in there have my h2 element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 317.88,
          "end": 321.84,
          "en": "which will later output the task title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 321.84,
          "end": 325.113,
          "en": "once we have some dynamic task data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 326.52,
          "end": 330.42,
          "en": "Then below that some time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 330.42,
          "end": 332.82,
          "en": "which will also be added in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 332.82,
          "end": 335.94,
          "en": "Then a summary of the task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 335.94,
          "end": 339.93,
          "en": "and then another paragraph with a class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 339.93,
          "end": 343.09000000000003,
          "en": "of actions where I wanna have a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 343.95,
          "end": 347.73,
          "en": "that will allow me to mark a task as completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 347.73,
          "end": 351.093,
          "en": "Again, we'll add some real data later, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 353.01,
          "end": 356.52,
          "en": "With that done, if we now select a user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 356.52,
          "end": 359.19,
          "en": "we see these task items here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 359.19,
          "end": 362.283,
          "en": "which arguably look better than what we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 363.36,
          "end": 365.64,
          "en": "But of course now it would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
